OL,3,AUS envoys head to meet Zelensky after
OL,4,Atalks with Putin in Moscow
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS envoys Jared Kushner and Steve
OL,7,FWitkoff held a fresh round of talks
OL,8,Fwith Russian President Vladimir Putin
OL,9,Fin Moscow, a day after the latest
OL,10,Fdiscussions aimed at ending the war in
OL,11,FUkraine wrapped up in Abu Dhabi.
OL,13,FThe pair are now flying to Dublin to
OL,14,Fmeet Ukraine's President Volodymyr
OL,15,FZelensky, and Witkoff said a new round
OL,16,Fof trilateral talks had already been
OL,17,Fagreed with Putin.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
